{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:52 2026-09-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:52 2026-09-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:52 2026-09-14 HKT</p><p>秀茂寶達邨發生車禍。今（14日）早上9時51分，一部的士沿寶琳路上斜往將軍澳方向，駛至寶達商場對出燈位，的士左邊撞倒一名過路男子，男子飛彈15米外倒地不起，頭傷呈半昏迷態，由救護員送往伊利沙伯醫院治理，的士左車身及燈罩損毀，警方在場調查意外原因，不排除有人衝燈肇禍。</p><img alt=\"捱撞男生半昏迷送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/541067586f867df190f81a21e0daa67c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_27_56.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士撞男途人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/33a3addb5a47361cd636e90cc4e1a8c3/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_27_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子頭傷送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/44bbce4162636da1c7275f7fd6868713/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_27_55.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士司機被帶署調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/533dd49f5ce9be2d4969ae7db5ac0583/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_54_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c89d680c89c405a352c3e92d4f12e899/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_54_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉事的士。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6e67dd94b6da2b178fc6c3390ecf0da/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_54_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"地面遺下血路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d7cff06cdeb6a7a61f5c3d770e99f59b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_54_12_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"的士撞男途人。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1aaa244bd35afd9586b20ff1d942ca01/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_54_12_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/df003ddd5ed692cde6878f1da741aa98/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-14_at_10_55_25.jpeg\"/><p></p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:53.242884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}